1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,660
What keeps an AI answer from becoming an unsafe action?

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:10,180
EMOS places deterministic controls around model reasoning, including input fencing,

3
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:15,980
output validation, canonical six R checks, and secret redaction.

4
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:19,960
Adversarial requests to bypass governance are intercepted.

5
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:26,080
Evidence requirements and explicit human approval remain authoritative, regardless of

6
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,780
the wording or confidence of a model response.

7
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:34,600
When AI reasoning is unavailable, the interface discloses a deterministic fallback.
